  title="Documentation Modernization and Publishing Automation at Synopsys"
  summary="Led documentation modernization from unstructured FrameMaker to DITA, built CI/CD publishing pipelines with GitHub Actions and Sphinx, and integrated Typesense search to improve discoverability across processor platform documentation."
  date="2015 - 2024"
